This product is a META-PROMPT system: it consists of behavioral instructions
and prompting patterns (Markdown/XML text), NOT executable code from the
projects listed below. The techniques integrated in v8C.3 are implemented as
PROMPTING PATTERNS INSPIRED BY published research. No third-party source code
is vendored. Attributions below are credits for intellectual inspiration; they
do not impose additional license obligations on this MIT-licensed work.


--- COMMUNITY & PHILOSOPHY ---------------------------------------------------

* Template M ("Karpathy Mode") — inspired by Andrej Karpathy's minimalist
  prompting philosophy ("best prompt is no prompt, just clean context").
* 4PDA community — bug reports, stress-tests, and non-standard use cases that
  shaped every patch of P2P from v1 to v8C.3.


